{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On a science test, Janine got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb7e03ccc8985ba9d029ea4add6e3e15ab9a953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> multiple choice questions correct and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/282fdef75f579c92565cd7e0734d83ccfd38bfdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> short answer questions correct. What percentage of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> questions on the test did she answer correctly.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/8728beec94262c092f15560e00f1f085c251f0ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 74\\% \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 72.5\\% \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 76\\% \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 73\\% \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 73.5\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"537\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can add the number of multiple choice questions that Janine did correctly added to the free-response/short answer questions that she got correct:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/63807b3f051e1f82f26afc50670c119c1c97868f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\% \\times 10 + 70\\% \\times 30 = 8 + 21 = 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"288\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Next, we can now find the percentage that she got right out of the total 40 questions:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/b/9db650fc426e8e81a432cb5453d5c25e14370386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{29}{40} \\times 100\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/7/bf7da9842620202e77032c719192235ba1f9136c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 72.5\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"95\" height=\"31\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofol